5. Commands in `commands/workspace.rs`: list/create/rename/archive/delete/set_current; registered through tauri-specta so `src/bindings.ts` is generated on build; `src/kernel/bridge/` wraps them with TanStack Query hooks (add `@tanstack/react-query`).
