### Phase 3 — AI engine and recorder (100 % local)

#### P3a — AI gateway + Ollama + companion drawer

```
Read docs/ai-engine.md §§3b–4 and docs/meetily-teardown.md §3.2 (what Meetily does with Ollama and what to do differently). Build `kernel/ai/`:
1. `models.rs`: tiers by detected RAM (`sysinfo`): fast = qwen3.5:4b, quality = qwen3.5:9b, embed = bge-m3; routing table by task kind per docs/ai-engine.md §4.
2. `ollama.rs`: health check (`/api/tags`), list/pull/delete with progress events, `/api/show` metadata (context length), `chat()` using `/api/chat` with `stream: true`, `options.num_ctx` always set, `keep_alive` per request; tokens and duration measured.
3. `scheduler.rs`: one heavy job at a time (queue), "model busy" state for the UI.
4. `log.rs`: `ai_log` table (workspace migration 0002) and writer.
5. Commands: `ai_status`, `ai_complete(task_kind, prompt, context)` streaming via Tauri events (`ai-token`, `ai-done`), `ai_cancel`.
6. Companion drawer (`src/modules/ai-companion`): toggle ⌘J, `.glass`, context = current workspace's open tasks + pinned notes (hub query, trimmed to the model's context), streams the answer, footer shows model/tokens/time; Settings → Models tab shows Ollama status, installed models, pull-recommended button.
Constraints: no cloud code; the UI never talks to Ollama directly. Done when: "What should I focus on this week in VIFC?" streams a grounded answer; killing Ollama produces a friendly "Ollama is not running — open it" state, not a crash.
```

#### P3b — Whisper engine, models page, audio import

```
Read docs/ai-engine.md §3a and §5 steps 2–3, docs/meetily-teardown.md §2 (all of it) and the reference code at ../Ref/meetily/frontend/src-tauri/src/{whisper_engine/whisper_engine.rs, audio/import.rs, audio/decoder.rs, audio/vad.rs, audio/common.rs, parakeet_engine/parakeet_engine.rs (downloader only)}. Port, do not copy.
Build:
1. `kernel/ai/whisper.rs` with `whisper-rs` (feature `metal`): load `large-v3-turbo` with `use_gpu=true`, `flash_attn=true`; ONE `WhisperState` per job reused across segments; params per docs/ai-engine.md §3a (beam 3, temp 0.2, thresholds, `n_threads` = performance cores, timestamps ON and offset by segment start); language explicit per call; a language-safe cleanup (whisper thresholds + short phrase list; no whitespace-based repetition collapsing); idle unload after N minutes (setting).
2. Models page (Settings → Models): Whisper catalogue (large-v3-turbo, large-v3-turbo-q5_0, large-v3) with SHA-256 from a pinned Hugging Face commit, Range-resume downloads, stall timeout, MB/s progress, cancel keeps partial, delete; stored in `<app_data_dir>/models/`.
3. `modules/meetings.rs` + migration 0003 (`meeting`, `transcript_segment`, `meeting_action_draft` per docs/plan.md §9) and the import pipeline: copy file → decode (`symphonia`; sample rate from the decoded stream) → mono, peak-normalise, `rubato` sinc to 16 kHz → Silero VAD (`silero_rs`, redemption 2000 ms, pads 300/400, min 250) → split > 25 s at the quietest window → transcribe → atomic save (DB transaction + `transcript.json` temp+rename). Staged progress events, cancel between stages. Audio stored under `attachments/recordings/<meeting-id>/`.
